 You can drive a convoy of concrete trucks onto the center span of a suspension bridge to prove the math holds.[_TT_1424]

459
00:30:10,100 --> 00:30:14,280
[_BEG_] You can prove the absolute integrity of the steel and the cables.[_TT_209]

460
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:15,660
 The math is flawless.[_TT_278]

461
